Short:    Displays a list of Brthdays and Events
Uploader: Jeepster@allhours.karoo.co.uk
Author:   Jeepster@allhours.karoo.co.uk
Type:     comm/bbs
Requires: Some BBS Software would be handy ;)
Replaces: History.lha

Now upto version 1.5. There will be no more upates to this program due to
the total apathy of the Sysop community in responding to my coding efforts.

Today  in  History simply displays some birthdays and events which happened
on  the current day sometime in history.  best of all its FREE!

There are English and German versions included in the archive.

Any BBS software that can run DOS doors. It uses no specific commands for
any particular BBS software. There are a few ANSI characters dotted about
the program. These help in positioning and colourisation of the final
display. There are NO backdoors in this program.

